{"id":2226,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2226"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:50:29","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:50:29","slug":"single-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/single-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Single Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>High-Quality Printing Options for Brand Recognition<\/h2>\n<p>We at <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a><\/strong> offer durable, high-quality <strong>single cardboard boxes<\/strong> for packaging and shipping individual items. Whether you&#8217;re sending a product sample, mailing a customer order, or preparing a single-piece retail package, these boxes are designed to offer protection and a clean, professional look.<\/p>\n<p>If you\u2019re wondering <strong>where to buy single shipping boxes<\/strong>, you\u2019re in the right place. Our boxes are fully customizable, available in a range of sizes and styles, and can be printed to match your branding. We manufacture <strong>single cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> for all industries\u2014from retail and cosmetics to electronics and gift products.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Practical Uses of Single Cardboard Shipping Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3>Perfect Fit for Lightweight and Heavy Products<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>single cardboard shipping boxes<\/strong> are available in a wide range of thicknesses and board strengths. Whether you need lightweight <strong>small shipping boxes<\/strong> for compact items or heavy-duty corrugated options for fragile goods, we\u2019ve got your packaging needs covered.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from eco Kraft, corrugated, or white SBS board<\/li>\n<li>Available in tuck top, mailer, and straight-end styles<\/li>\n<li>Flat-packed for easy storage and assembly<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Boxes are ideal for:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Books and promotional kits<\/li>\n<li>Skincare and beauty products<\/li>\n<li>Small gadgets or tech accessories<\/li>\n<li>Apparel and accessories<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Strong Enough for Safe Transit<\/h3>\n<p>Each <strong>single shipping box<\/strong> is built to hold and protect one product during handling, stacking, or shipping. Reinforced sides and secure flaps minimize the risk of damage.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Features and Options<\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 385px;\" width=\"897\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature<\/th>\n<th>Description<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sizes<\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom (Small to Oversized)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated E-Flute, Kraft, White SBS, Bux Board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, One-Color, Two-Color, Full-Top Print<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Styles Available<\/td>\n<td>Mailer, Tuck-End, Straight-End, Seal-End<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Strength<\/td>\n<td>Single Wall, Double Wall, Reinforced Corners<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food Safe<\/td>\n<td>FDA-Approved Options Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days (Rush Available)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Proofs<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, Physical Sample (On Request)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Custom Design Assistance<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<div class=\"flex basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:55px] grow overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full\">\n<div class=\"flex h-full flex-col overflow-y-auto [scrollbar-gutter:stable_both-edges] @[84rem]\/thread:pt-(--header-height)\">\n<div class=\"@thread-xl\/thread:pt-header-height flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-30\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"9cc97074-1308-45f4-8dcd-f0bfdd99284b\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\">\n<h2 data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3082\"><strong data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3082\">Single Cardboard Boxes for Sale in All Sizes<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3121\"><strong data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3121\">Flexibility in Size and Structure<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3317\">We offer <strong data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3167\">single cardboard boxes for sale<\/strong> in custom shapes and sizes. Whether you need a narrow box for a candle or a square box for a keepsake, we make it easy to define your own dimensions.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3488\">\n<li data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3385\">\n<p data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3385\"><strong data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3345\">Small shipping boxes<\/strong> for e-commerce and subscription items<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3434\">\n<p data-start=\"3388\" data-end=\"3434\">Medium sizes for cosmetics and wellness kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3488\">\n<p data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3488\">Large sizes for packaging single premium products<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3663\">Our boxes can be die-cut or scored depending on your layout and fit. With clean edges and strong closure systems, your packaging will stay intact from warehouse to doorstep.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3819\">If you&#8217;re comparing packaging types based on durability, you can also refer to our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength\/\"><strong data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3788\">Cardboard Boxes by Material Strength<\/strong><\/a> category for relevant options.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1083\"><strong data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1083\">Use Plain or With Branding<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1343\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">If you prefer minimal packaging, we also supply <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1165\">single cardboard boxes empty<\/strong> without printing. These are great for in-house labeling, custom stamps, or product testing shipments. You can also choose to print only one panel or opt for full-color branding.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3729\">Dimensions and Styles Overview<\/h2>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"4610\">\n<thead data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3844\">\n<tr data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3844\">\n<th data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3733\" data-end=\"3743\">Aspect<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3763\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3762\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3763\" data-end=\"3786\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3785\">Material Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3810\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3788\" data-end=\"3809\">Finishing Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3810\" data-end=\"3824\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3823\">Add-Ons<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3844\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3842\">Applications<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4610\">\n<tr data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4091\">\n<td data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"3979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Small Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">For candles, perfumes, stationery<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4028\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4028\" data-end=\"4043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4061\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom Cut-Outs<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4061\" data-end=\"4091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail Shelf, Subscription<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4226\">\n<td data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Medium Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4139\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetics, skincare, kits<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4160\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated E-Flute<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4160\" data-end=\"4176\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spot UV, Foil<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4194\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4226\" data-col-size=\"sm\">E-commerce, Retail Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4367\">\n<td data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Large Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4274\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Apparel, premium products<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4274\" data-end=\"4298\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bux Board, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4311\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4336\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Handles, Window Panels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4367\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gift Packaging, Launch Kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4491\">\n<td data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4387\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Layout Styles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4420\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tuck-End, Mailer, Straight-End<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4420\" data-end=\"4438\" data-col-size=\"sm\">All board types<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4438\" data-end=\"4454\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth Finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4469\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Secure Flaps<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4491\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping &amp; Storage<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4610\">\n<td data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4511\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4533\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Plain or Full Print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4549\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom Papers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4567\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inside Printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4567\" data-end=\"4583\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo, Barcode<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4583\" data-end=\"4610\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail Branding, Labels<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/article>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Single Cardboard Boxes Wholesale for Efficient Operations<\/h2>\n<h3>Why Bulk Orders Make Business Sense<\/h3>\n<p>Ordering <strong>single cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> gives you control over packaging inventory and reduces your cost per unit. It\u2019s a great solution for retailers, manufacturers, and direct-to-consumer brands.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Bulk pricing available for 500+ units<\/li>\n<li>Fast reordering and consistent quality<\/li>\n<li>Reduced lead times with pre-approved designs<\/li>\n<li>Seamless coordination for seasonal campaigns or launches<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h2 data-start=\"5232\" data-end=\"5265\">Printing and Coating Choices<\/h2>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"6121\">\n<thead data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5381\">\n<tr data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5381\">\n<th data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5285\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5281\">Category<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5285\" data-end=\"5299\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5287\" data-end=\"5298\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5299\" data-end=\"5322\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5301\" data-end=\"5321\">Material Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5344\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5324\" data-end=\"5343\">Coating Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5365\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5364\">Design Add-Ons<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5381\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5379\">Best Use<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"5498\" data-end=\"6121\">\n<tr data-start=\"5498\" data-end=\"5629\">\n<td data-start=\"5498\" data-end=\"5517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-Color Prints<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5555\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimalist branding, cost-effective<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5555\" data-end=\"5579\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, Recycled Paper<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5579\" data-end=\"5587\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5599\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo Only<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5599\" data-end=\"5629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco Brands, Bulk Shipments<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5749\">\n<td data-start=\"5630\" data-end=\"5649\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full-Color Prints<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5649\" data-end=\"5679\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Impactful, vibrant branding<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5679\" data-end=\"5697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SBS, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5697\" data-end=\"5705\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5727\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Full Panel Graphics<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail, Promotions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5750\" data-end=\"5875\">\n<td data-start=\"5750\" data-end=\"5769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inside Printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Special messages, coupons<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5817\" data-col-size=\"sm\">All board options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5817\" data-end=\"5827\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">QR Codes, Custom Notes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5852\" data-end=\"5875\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Customer Engagement<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"6004\">\n<td data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"5897\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protective Coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Prevents scratches, smudges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5927\" data-end=\"5947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">All board choices<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5947\" data-end=\"5967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft Touch, Matte<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5967\" data-end=\"5982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Premium Feel<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5982\" data-end=\"6004\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetics, Jewelry<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"6005\" data-end=\"6121\">\n<td data-start=\"6005\" data-end=\"6023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rush Production<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6043\" data-col-size=\"sm\">4\u20136 Business Days<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6043\" data-end=\"6068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Available on all types<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6068\" data-end=\"6083\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6083\" data-end=\"6100\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Priority Setup<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6100\" data-end=\"6121\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Seasonal Launches<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Coating and Finishing Options to Match Your Brand<\/h2>\n<h3>Add a Professional Look<\/h3>\n<p>Coating options don\u2019t just improve visual appeal\u2014they also protect your box surface from scuffs, smudges, and handling marks. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/single-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"402\">Single Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> are available with multiple coating styles to suit both branding and durability needs.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gloss<\/strong>: Adds a shiny, polished finish<\/li>\n<li><strong>Matte<\/strong>: Offers a smooth, glare-free surface<\/li>\n<li><strong>Spot UV<\/strong>: Highlights logos or text selectively<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These coatings pair well with textured papers, minimalist branding, or premium product inserts.<\/p>\n<h3>Custom Design and Printing Features<\/h3>\n<p>Printing helps communicate your brand, product details, or safety instructions clearly.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>One-color prints for minimal designs<\/li>\n<li>Full-panel prints for maximum impact<\/li>\n<li>Inside panel printing for special notes or instructions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Our in-house design team can assist with layout adjustments, logo placement, and artwork setup\u2014free of charge.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"291\"><strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"291\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is the Right Choice<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"639\">\n<li data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"359\">\n<p data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"359\"><strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"337\">Custom single cardboard boxes for sale<\/strong> with print or plain<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"404\">\n<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"404\">Multiple finishes: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"452\">\n<p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"452\">Free design assistance and mock-up previews<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"498\">\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"498\">Fast production and rush delivery options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"553\">\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"553\">Strong, recyclable material with food-safe options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"602\">\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"602\">Custom sizes and shapes for any product type<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"639\">\n<p data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"639\">Free shipping on all bulk orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Need single cardboard boxes? Get high-quality boxes at wholesale prices. We offer various coating options like gloss, matte, and spot UV. Free design and shipping are available. Need custom sizes or styles? No problem! We have fast turnaround times and offer high-quality materials and printing options. Order today and experience superior service!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2291,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[180],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2226","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength","rishi-post","first","instock","s